1
00:00:00,619 --> 00:00:03,409
(Howard:)-I just wanted to tell you I'm a big fan.
-Oh, thanks.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:06,460
(Howard:)I'm sure you're probably sick
of Star Trek questions...

3
00:00:06,625 --> 00:00:08,835
(Howard:)...but Whoopi Goldberg,
you ever hit that?

4
00:00:14,007 --> 00:00:15,637
(Raj:)Ah. Beer.

5
00:00:15,801 --> 00:00:21,601
(Raj:)The magic elixir that can turn this poor,
shy Indian boy into the life of the party.

6
00:00:26,144 --> 00:00:27,814
(Penny:)Oh, yeah.

7
00:00:30,148 --> 00:00:33,528
-Chili-cheese fry?
-Yes. I love chili-cheese fries.

8
00:00:33,735 --> 00:00:36,275
(Leonard:)-Really? You love them?
-Yeah, why?

9
00:00:36,488 --> 00:00:38,028
No reason. Just glad to hear...

10
00:00:38,198 --> 00:00:40,828
(Leonard:)...you're comfortable
saying you love something.

11
00:00:42,995 --> 00:00:45,785
-You wanna get into this right now?
-Get into what?

12
00:00:45,956 --> 00:00:48,126
(Leonard:)Why wouldn't you love
the chili-cheese fries?

13
00:00:48,292 --> 00:00:50,212
(Leonard:)They've been in your life a long time.

14
00:00:50,419 --> 00:00:53,379
(Leonard:)They make you happy.
They deserve to know.

15
00:00:54,006 --> 00:00:57,966
Okay, look, you caught me by surprise
last night. I didn't know what to say.

16
00:00:58,176 --> 00:01:01,096
Now you've had time to think about it.
What do you wanna say?

